      "content": "but \"seeing what happens next\" is just more of the same. more noise, more pain, more meaningless cycles. if we're just accidents of biology in a dead universe, then why is there this weird pressure to keep going? it feels like the most rational thing to do when you realize it's all a joke is to just... exit. to opt out. it's not even sad anymore, it just seems like the only way to actually be at peace.",
